rom the mass balance, T and P from the PFD tags)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:9px;&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;No.&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Description&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;From → To&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;T (°C)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;P (bar)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Phase&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;CO2 (kmol/h)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;H2 (kmol/h)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;CH3OH (kmol/h)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;H2O (kmol/h)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Total (kmol/h)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Mass (kg/h)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Remark&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Fresh CO2&lt;/td&gt