;390.9&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;12,500&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;T, P at T-101 top (dew point); flow = net product; 99.9 wt%&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;10&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Purge&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;V-101 gas → flare&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;45&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;49&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Vapor&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;8.9&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;28.9&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;37.8&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;449&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;0.5 % of stream 5&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:8px;margin-top:3px;&quot;&gt;* At 308 °C, 50 bar and H2:CO2 = 3.2 the equilibrium CO2 conversion is only about 13 %, below the 18 % per pass used in the mass balance: the reactor needs cooling or a lower inlet temperature.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1080" width="1330" height="235" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="kb_47" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;TABLE 2 - OTHER LINE CONDITIONS (tags without a stream number)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:9px;&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Line&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Flow as stream&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;T (°C)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;P (bar)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Basis&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;After K-101&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;149&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;50&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;4 stages, intercoolers to 45 °C, no aftercooler (calculated, η = 0.75)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;After K-102&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;89&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;50&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;1 stage, 30 → 50 bar (calculated, η = 0.75)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Reactor inlet (E-101 out)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;230&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;50&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;HPS 41 bar heats stream 3 (about 14 MW, estimate)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;E-102 outlet (before PCV-101)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;45&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;50&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Cooling water; PCV-101 then drops to 49 bar&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Column feed (after FCV-104)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;7&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;70&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;1.2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Below its boiling point (77 °C, NRTL estimate); 1.2 bar = column pressure&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1370" y="1080" width="690" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="kb_48" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;TABLE 3 - CONTROL VALVE SCHEDULE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:9px;&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Tag&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Location / service&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Fluid&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Flow (kg/h)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;T (°C)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;P (bar)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Controls&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Fail&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #777;background:#DDE6F2;padding:2px 4px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Reason for fail position&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;FCV-101&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;CO2 feed, after K-101&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;CO2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;17,579 (399.5 kmol/h)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;149&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;50&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C00000&quot;&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Stops the CO2 feed on failure; the H2 feed stops with it, so the 3:1 ratio is kept.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;FCV-102&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;H2 feed, after K-102&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;H2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;2,401 (1,200.7 kmol/h)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;89&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;50&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C00000&quot;&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Same as FCV-101: no reactants fed without control.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;PCV-101&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;E-102 → V-101 (original valve)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;CO2, H2, CH3OH, H2O&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;109,375&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;45&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;50 → 49&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;pressure&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#007A33&quot;&gt;FO&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Opens on failure so the reactor loop cannot be over-pressured by a closed valve.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;FCV-103&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Purge (stream 10), V-101 gas → flare&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;CO2, H2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;449 (37.8 kmol/h)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;45&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;49 → flare&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C00000&quot;&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Keeps flammable H2 in the plant; over-pressure is covered by a relief valve (not drawn).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;LCV-101&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;V-101 bottoms → E-103 (stream 7)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;CH3OH, H2O, dissolved gas&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;19,531&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;45&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;49 → above 1.2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;level&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C00000&quot;&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Closes so 49 bar gas cannot blow through into the column system.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;FCV-104&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;E-103 → T-101 feed&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;CH3OH, H2O&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;19,531&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;70&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;above 1.2 → 1.2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C00000&quot;&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Stops feeding the column on failure (avoids flooding).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;FCV-105&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Reflux to T-101&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;CH3OH&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;about 12,400 (R ≈ 1.0 estimate)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;not tagged&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;1.2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#007A33&quot;&gt;FO&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Keeps reflux so the overhead temperature cannot rise.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;FCV-106&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Methanol product (stream 9)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;CH3OH, 0.1 wt% H2O&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;12,500&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;not tagged&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;1.2 → product&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C00000&quot;&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Closes to keep inventory; condensate then goes to reflux.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;LCV-102&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Water product (stream 8)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;H2O, 0.18 wt% CH3OH&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;7,031&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;105&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;1.2 → product&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;level&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C00000&quot;&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Keeps the sump level and protects P-103 from running dry.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;TCV-101&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;HPS to E-101&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Steam&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;about 30 t/h (14 MW, est.)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;254&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;41 bar&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;temperature&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C00000&quot;&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Stops heating on failure so the reactor feed cannot overheat.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;TCV-103&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Cooling water to E-102&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Water&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;about 2,500 t/h (29 MW, est.)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;30 → 40&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;temperature&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#007A33&quot;&gt;FO&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Maximum cooling on failure: hot gas must not reach V-101.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;TCV-104&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;LPS to E-103&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Steam&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;about 0.7 t/h (0.4 MW, est.)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;160&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;5 barg&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;temperature&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C00000&quot;&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Stops heating on failure.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;TCV-105&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Cooling water to E-104&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Water&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;about 650 t/h (7.6 MW, est.)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;30 → 40&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;temperature&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#007A33&quot;&gt;FO&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Loss of condensation would over-pressure T-101.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;TCV-106&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;LPS to E-105&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Steam&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;about 13.5 t/h (7.8 MW, est.)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;160&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;5 barg&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;temperature&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C00000&quot;&gt;FC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:2px 4px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Stops boil-up on failure (avoids column flooding / over-pressure).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:8px;margin-top:3px;&quot;&gt;Flows of streams 1-10 are from the mass balance. Utility flows, reflux and the E-101 / E-102 / E-104 / E-105 duties are estimates (ideal-gas heat capacities, shortcut column model): confirm by simulation. &quot;not tagged&quot; = no temperature is given on the PFD. TCV-102 is intentionally unused.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;spacing=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1330" width="2040" height="305" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>